<section class="how" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title"><div class="how-track" id="how-track"><div class="how-sticky"><div class="wrap how-grid"><div><h2 class="h2" id="how-title">Six weeks from idea to validated business</h2><p class="how-intro">One clear journey. Each week adds a piece, until your idea has the shape of a real business opportunity.</p><ol class="phases" id="phases"><li class="phase is-active"><span class="phase-num">1</span><div><h3>Apply</h3><p>Tell us about you, your startup and the support you need. It takes about ten minutes.</p></div></li><li class="phase"><span class="phase-num">2</span><div><h3>Join the cohort</h3><p>Selected founders start the programme together.</p></div></li><li class="phase"><span class="phase-num">3</span><div><h3>Six weeks of mentorship and training</h3><p>Work on your startup week by week, with mentors and practical training alongside you.</p></div></li><li class="phase"><span class="phase-num">4</span><div><h3>Leave with a validated opportunity</h3><p>Finish with a tested business idea and a foundation for building something sustainable.</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="journey" aria-hidden="true"><div class="journey-top"><div class="week-count" id="week-count">Week 1<small>of 6</small></div><div class="journey-state" id="journey-state">Your idea, in pieces</div></div><svg class="journey-svg" id="journey-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 380"></svg><div class="weeks-wrap"><span class="weeks-fill" id="weeks-fill"></span><ol class="weeks" id="weeks"></ol></div><div class="journey-ends"><div><strong>Your idea</strong>Where you start</div><div><strong>A validated opportunity</strong>Where you finish</div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
